WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.660
In Sora and Kurosaki's battle, they turned the 
Solid Vision Heartland City into a battlefield.

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:12.260
Stop it!  This isn't a duel!

00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:15.960
The duel that I believe 
in makes everyone happy!

00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.460
Sora!

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:33.850
Kurosaki is the winner!

00:00:37.420 --> 00:00:39.800
Wait!  Don't run away!

00:00:40.020 --> 00:00:45.080
Duel me again...

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:47.240
Sora!

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:49.800
Sora!

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:52.040
Sora!

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:58.900
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:04.110
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:07.110
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:11.310
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:14.070
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:16.740
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:19.540
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:30.630
A future filled with hope 
and anxiety now begins

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:36.100
Don't worry because you have firm desires

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:41.730
I fight to reach the day that I yearn for

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:45.840
The gleaming strength resides inside the card

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:49.780
Repeating Up/Down

00:01:49.780 --> 00:01:52.140
Feel It!  The heartbeat Bu,Bu,Bu,Burn!

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:59.390
I become stronger by overcoming 
and shaking off limitations again

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.850
Because I don't want to give up

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:07.830
Ride the accelerating wind and head towards

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:14.930
My dream that makes me love tomorrow

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:25.440
Break through those clouds and draw 
your dazzling dreams in the blue sky

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:28.120
Let's start!  From an instant flash

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.820
Let's find!  Yeah, the way I ought to go

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:33.650
Let's start!  The fun is only getting started

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:36.390
Ready go!  The real beginning

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:46.010
Academia and Resistance

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.340
Sora...

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:01.820
He'll be fine.  LDS has 
an excellent medical team.

00:03:02.100 --> 00:03:07.770
But what if the debris from the building 
hit him before the Field Spell ended?

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:13.720
Syun Kurosaki!

00:03:15.180 --> 00:03:20.880
Sora Shinunin is receiving medical attention 
at the center court's medical room.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:25.900
He has wounds on his head, arms and feet, 
but they're nothing life-threatening.

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.160
I see.

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.820
After he's done receiving medical attention,

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:32.790
transfer him to Leo Corporation headquarters.

00:03:33.840 --> 00:03:36.630
There are things I want to ask him about.

00:03:38.080 --> 00:03:41.700
Also bring his Duel Disk to me.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.230
Understood.

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:50.820
Yoko and I will take the kids 
home, so take care of Sora.

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:54.730
What do you think?

00:03:56.020 --> 00:03:59.430
Kurosaki is the culprit who attacked LDS.

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:04.020
I saw him defeat Top Team, and Yuzu...

00:04:04.130 --> 00:04:08.630
When Masumi was pursuing the 
culprit, I saw someone attack her.

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:09.960
But Masumi said...

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:12.130
What are you talking about?

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:14.670
He's been our teammate from the start.

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:17.440
She's calling her enemy a teammate?

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.870
I don't know why Masumi said that.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:25.410
But Ute said that he was attacking 
LDS in order to save his friends.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:27.570
Ute...

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:40.190
Our enemy took our dear friend, 
so we are trying to rescue her.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:44.460
So Ute attacked Sawatari?

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:47.780
Why didn't you say anything earlier?

00:04:47.780 --> 00:04:51.730
If you told the truth, Yuya 
wouldn't have been framed-

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:54.670
Did you think Yuya was the culprit?

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.860
Of course not!  Because Yuya doesn't use Xyz.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.070
However...

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:08.840
Ute is a person who looks just like me.

00:05:09.820 --> 00:05:13.370
Is he the guy that vanishes 
whenever your bracelet glows?

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:14.500
Vanishes?

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:20.300
I don't know why Ute vanishes 
when this bracelet glows.

00:05:20.960 --> 00:05:25.240
I thought Yuya might be wearing a disguise, 
but there's no reason why he would do that.

00:05:25.980 --> 00:05:29.130
Or why Yuya would attack LDS.

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:35.080
He's attacking to save his 
friends from his enemy.

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.840
Yes, that's what Ute said.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:41.030
Who's the enemy?  Isn't it LDS?

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:45.130
It's...

00:06:03.460 --> 00:06:05.010
Fusion is the enemy?

00:06:05.300 --> 00:06:07.480
That's what Ute said?

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.800
Kurosaki is Ute's friend.

00:06:11.800 --> 00:06:15.060
Is that why he's hostile towards Sora?

00:06:15.060 --> 00:06:19.260
Do you know where Sora is from?

00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:21.160
No.

00:06:21.160 --> 00:06:23.900
Whenever I ask, he changes the subject.

00:06:24.180 --> 00:06:30.140
There might be some connection 
between Kurosaki, Ute and Sora.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:31.270
Connection?

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:38.010
Since Kurosaki uses Xyz, maybe Sora 
is from a rival Fusion school.

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:43.080
This is all for fun.  I don't 
need to take it seriously.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:45.300
Even my teammates feel the same.

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:49.220
We're hunting you for fun.

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:54.890
Did Sora's team take Kurosaki 
and Ute's teammate?

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.970
Yuya?

00:07:09.980 --> 00:07:11.640
I want to ask you something.

00:07:12.100 --> 00:07:13.080
You!

00:07:14.270 --> 00:07:16.400
Where is Ruri?

00:07:16.400 --> 00:07:17.500
Ruri?

00:07:19.180 --> 00:07:21.800
Their teammate is Kurosaki's younger sister?

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:23.860
Yes.  That's what Ute said.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:28.120
If Sora's team kidnapped 
Kurosaki's sister Ruri,

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:33.300
I can understand why they 
have animosity towards Sora.

00:07:33.300 --> 00:07:34.100
But...

00:07:34.480 --> 00:07:38.300
So Kurosaki joined LDS 
in order to battle Sora?

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:42.430
No, that's not true.  Masumi said 
he's been with LDS from the start.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:47.480
So why would he attack LDS in 
order to get his sister back?

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:51.580
I don't understand!  What's going on?

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:53.900
Fusion and Xyz...

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:57.020
This isn't a simple conflict between schools.

00:07:57.020 --> 00:08:00.100
I sense something bigger.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:04.300
I don't know Ruri.  Why would I know her?

00:08:04.300 --> 00:08:07.260
Then where are the ones who kidnapped her?

00:08:07.260 --> 00:08:08.280
I don't know.

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:12.140
I only know that there's no such 
thing as a prisoner of war.

00:08:12.140 --> 00:08:13.410
No such thing?

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:16.380
Because the hunted are turned into cards.

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:18.600
That means she's probably...

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:21.580
Anyway, where is he?

00:08:21.800 --> 00:08:22.840
He?

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:27.570
Syun Kurosaki!  I have to 
settle things with him!

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:32.460
It's already been settled.  You lost.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:37.100
I didn't lose!  There's no way 
I would lose against an Xyz!

00:08:37.100 --> 00:08:40.700
Take me to him!  I'll crush him this time!

00:08:40.700 --> 00:08:43.770
If I duel seriously, I'll beat him easily!

00:08:43.770 --> 00:08:45.170
What's the ruckus?

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:46.900
Over here.

00:08:48.420 --> 00:08:49.370
Who are you?

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:53.410
Stop!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.080
You shouldn't move around!

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:56.480
Out of my way!

00:08:59.220 --> 00:09:00.000
Find him?

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:01.370
He's not over here!

00:09:01.920 --> 00:09:02.870
Where did he go?

00:09:02.870 --> 00:09:04.070
I'll search over there!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.390
What's with the commotion?

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:08.870
He may have already gone outside.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:12.180
Contact headquarters immediately and 
tell them that Sora Shiunin has escaped!

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:12.840
Understood!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:19.710
I'll dispatch teams all around Maiami City 
and find out where Sora Shiunin went.

00:09:19.940 --> 00:09:22.900
No, we're currently in the 
middle of a tournament.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:24.800
Don't create a bigger commotion.

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:25.830
But...

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:30.920
Use the security cameras throughout 
the city to find his location.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:34.000
I'm going to the control room.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:39.030
My dad said that he's coming soon.

00:09:39.030 --> 00:09:41.970
Okay.  Let's split up and search.

00:09:41.970 --> 00:09:43.360
I'll go towards the ocean.

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.930
I'll go to the central park.

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.670
I'll go that way.

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.170
Where is he?

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:04.630
Central park!

00:10:04.630 --> 00:10:07.100
Send teams immediately and capture him!

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:08.480
Wait.

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:20.400
Point the camera in the direction 
that Sora Shiunin is facing.

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.110
Who's that?

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:29.520
Hurry up and call Syun Kurosaki!

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:37.350
That's...

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.580
Yuya Sakaki?

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:40.620
No.

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:43.820
He's Ute.

00:10:44.680 --> 00:10:45.860
Ute?

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:49.260
He's my friend.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:11:06.580
I see.  I believed that there were two Xyz 
users targeting LDS, so it's Ute and you.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:11.050
His face is completely 
identical to Yuya Sakaki's.

00:11:18.320 --> 00:11:21.460
Hurry up and bring out Kurosaki!

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:25.160
You want to battle Syun again 
even though you're badly hurt?

00:11:25.160 --> 00:11:28.130
That's right!  I won't lose this time!

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:30.240
Not to him!

00:11:30.240 --> 00:11:35.080
The people of Xyz are 
destined to be hunted by us.

00:11:35.300 --> 00:11:39.410
You, Kurosaki, even that 
Ruri you were talking about!

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:44.300
I can't lose against an Xyz user!

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:49.020
I'll prove that when I'm 
serious, I'm the stronger one!

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:52.730
If you're hiding him, I 
won't show you any mercy!

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:56.030
I don't know where she is.

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:58.670
She's probably been turned into a card.

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:03.700
But there may be one way to save her.

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:04.670
What?

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.910
How can we save her?

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:10.380
By defeating us.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:15.740
But that's impossible for you to do.

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:18.320
Stop, Kurosaki!

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:19.630
Let me go!

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:20.720
No.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:24.400
If you go, it would cause 
a greater commotion.

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:28.720
If that leads to the cancellation 
of the Maiami Championship,

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:31.730
my entire plan will come to nothing.

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:39.500
Don't forget that this event is a test to 
select duelists who will fight against Leo Akaba.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:43.100
And it seems you don't need to go.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:56.630
So you feel like dueling 
now?  That's the spirit!

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:59.930
I'll defeat you first and 
then defeat Kurosaki.

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:03.860
I'll eliminate all Xyz users 
in this world by myself!

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:05.330
I won't let that happen.

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:08.660
In order to rescue Ruri, I'll start with you!

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:09.970
Duel!

00:13:11.220 --> 00:13:13.710
I go first!  My turn!

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:17.820
I summon Edge Imp Tomahawk from my hand!

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:28.250
Once per turn, Edge Imp Tomahawk 
can deal you 800 points of damage

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:32.760
by sending one Edge Imp monster 
in my hand to the graveyard.

00:13:37.680 --> 00:13:40.490
This was my way of saying hello.

00:13:40.490 --> 00:13:42.140
I end my turn.

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:45.270
800 points of damage already.

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:50.140
Don't worry.  This amount of damage 
isn't enough to make Ute flinch.

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.380
Watch closely.

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.860
Are you okay?

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:06.790
I'll let you call Kurosaki so 
that you can switch places.

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:09.260
My turn!

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:13.330
I summon The Phantom 
Knights of Ancient Cloak!

00:14:16.760 --> 00:14:19.640
You're starting with a monster 
with 800 attack points.

00:14:19.640 --> 00:14:24.780
What will you do next, you Xyz loser?

00:14:25.360 --> 00:14:29.150
When a Level 3 Phantom Knight is on my field,

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:33.680
I can Special Summon The Phantom 
Knights of Silent Boots from my hand.

00:14:38.660 --> 00:14:39.740
I see.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:43.480
Since you have two Level 3 monsters...

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:50.870
I overlay Level 3 The Phantom Knights 
of Ancient Cloak and Silent Boots!

00:14:54.860 --> 00:14:57.840
The souls of the fallen 
knights on the battlefield,

00:14:58.320 --> 00:15:02.080
resurrect and become the light 
that cuts through the darkness!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:03.750
Xyz Summon!

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:08.090
Appear, Rank 3 The Phantom 
Knights of Break Sword!

00:15:14.060 --> 00:15:16.460
A Xyz Monster arrived!

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:20.500
Let's battle!

00:15:20.500 --> 00:15:24.170
Break Sword attacks Edge Imp Tomahawk!

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:33.300
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:15:34.760 --> 00:15:39.220
I guess if you couldn't duel this 
well, you wouldn't be worth dueling.

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.140
It's no good!

00:15:41.140 --> 00:15:43.920
I've called him many times, 
but he's not answering!

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:46.070
Gongenzaka said the same thing.

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:48.560
Sora, where did you go?

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:50.330
Let's keep searching for him!

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:51.760
I'll call you later!

00:15:53.420 --> 00:15:58.940
Since you were able to Xyz, it's 
about time I get serious too.

00:15:59.480 --> 00:16:00.410
My turn!

00:16:01.600 --> 00:16:05.610
I activate the spell card 
Polymerization from my hand!

00:16:07.300 --> 00:16:11.950
I fuse Fluffal Bear and Edge 
Imp Sabres from my hand.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.760
Devil's claws and beast's fangs!

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:20.290
Become one in the whirlpool of mystery!  
Show your new power and look!

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:21.990
Fusion Summon!

00:16:23.300 --> 00:16:27.420
Appear, the hair-raising beast 
that slashes everything!

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.880
Frightfur Bear!

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.180
Sora...

00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:46.520
That's...

00:16:49.340 --> 00:16:50.990
He looks just like me.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:53.680
Is he the Ute that Yuzu was talking about?

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:55.950
Let's battle!

00:16:55.950 --> 00:16:58.900
Frightfur Bear attacks Break Sword!

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.440
Break Sword's effect activates.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:11.340
When this monster leaves the field,

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:15.280
I can Special Summon the monsters that were 
used to summon it as Level 4 monsters!

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:20.800
The Phantom Knights won't fall!

00:17:20.800 --> 00:17:23.020
Even if you defeat them, they'll resurrect!

00:17:23.020 --> 00:17:25.990
This is how the Resistance fights!

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:28.230
Resistance?

00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:31.560
Fusion is the enemy.

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.400
Frightfur Bear's effect activates!

00:17:34.400 --> 00:17:39.200
Once per turn, it can equip a monster 
that it destroyed in battle!

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:53.020
Its attack points are added to 
Frightfur Bear's attack points!

00:17:56.180 --> 00:18:02.030
Your Xyz Monster will be nothing more 
than nutrition for Frightfur Bear.

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:06.380
Go ahead and use your resurrected 
monsters to Xyz Summon.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:08.270
I'll swallow it up too!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:11.700
I set one card and end my turn!

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:14.710
My turn!

00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:20.320
I overlay Level 4 The Phantom Knights 
of Ancient Cloak and Silent Boots!

00:18:23.130 --> 00:18:24.650
You're really going to do it!

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:28.350
From the black darkness,

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:33.780
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:18:34.520 --> 00:18:36.460
Xyz Summon!

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:42.300
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:49.660
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon?

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:55.230
What's the point of summoning a 
monster with only 2500 attack points?

00:18:55.230 --> 00:18:59.590
Frightfur Bear has 4200 attack points.

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:03.720
I activate Dark Rebellion 
Xyz Dragon's effect!

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:08.030
By using one Overlay Unit, 
until the end of this turn...

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:12.430
...your Level 5-or-above monster's 
attack points are halved,

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:17.200
and Dark Rebellion Xyz 
Dragon gains that amount!

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:19.670
Treason Discharge!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:23.500
This is bad.  If he uses 
the remaining Overlay Unit,

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:26.580
Frightfur Bear's attack 
points will drop to 1050.

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:31.730
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon 
will have 5650 attack points.

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:32.920
Let's battle!

00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:33.650
What?

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:38.930
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon 
attacks Frightfur Bear!

00:19:42.220 --> 00:19:46.130
Lightning Disobey of Rebellion!

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:55.770
It's not a Solid Vision 
field, but I felt an impact?

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.130
I end my turn.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:06.960
Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's 
attack points return to normal.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:10.370
Sora!

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:12.890
That's...

00:20:14.260 --> 00:20:15.980
Yuya Sakaki.

00:20:17.060 --> 00:20:18.830
Are you okay, Sora?

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:21.800
Go away!  This doesn't involve you, Yuya!

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:23.570
What are you talking about?

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:26.120
You're so hurt that you need 
to stay at the hospital,

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:28.520
so why would you escape and duel?

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:37.630
How dare he!  He's taking it easy on me!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:40.190
Damn!  He's insulting me!

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:45.120
I won't forgive him!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.980
That's enough!  Stop!

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:48.940
If you keep dueling, your body will-

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:51.900
Be quiet!  I haven't used 
my full strength yet!

00:20:51.900 --> 00:20:56.040
If I get serious, he'll find 
out that I'm the stronger one!

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:58.800
You can do that any other time!

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.200
Do it in the next tournament!

00:21:00.200 --> 00:21:04.170
There is no "next" in a real battle!

00:21:04.170 --> 00:21:05.500
Exactly.

00:21:06.760 --> 00:21:11.250
Even though you're my enemy, I cannot 
bring myself to hurt you any further.

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:16.160
If you surrender, I will end 
this without having you suffer.

00:21:17.280 --> 00:21:20.390
What are you going to do to Sora?

00:21:22.580 --> 00:21:23.760
Answer me!

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:27.100
Kurosaki was also planning 
to do something to Sora!

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:33.840
He said that if I wanted to save 
Ruri, I had to destroy Fusion.

00:21:34.060 --> 00:21:35.070
Ruri...

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:41.800
A tiny crack can lead to the 
destruction of a giant building.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:48.720
You will be the tiny crack that will 
destroy the wall known as Fusion.

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:57.930
Stop it!

00:21:58.160 --> 00:22:01.300
I won't allow you to hurt my friend!

00:22:04.320 --> 00:22:06.630
If you want to battle, I'll be your opponent!

00:22:31.280 --> 00:22:35.910
As long as there's a smile

00:22:38.150 --> 00:22:42.690
I'll risk my ultimate pride

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:47.990
I always believe

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:51.510
In my tomorrow

00:22:51.860 --> 00:22:57.140
With courageous wings
Just fly away!

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:05.780
This duel of the soul 
(Break through the darkness with the miracle card!)

00:23:05.780 --> 00:23:12.630
A battle that surpasses clashing dimensions 
(The fun is only getting started!)

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:19.320
For everyone to acquire their own dreams

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:23.390
We go towards the mightiest future

00:23:49.300 --> 00:23:52.360
I won't allow you to hurt my friend!

00:23:52.360 --> 00:23:54.600
If you want to battle, I'll be your opponent!

00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:57.960
Don't interfere in my duel!  He's my prey!

00:23:57.960 --> 00:23:58.960
Prey?

00:23:58.960 --> 00:24:01.360
You're in my way, Yuya!  Get out of here!

00:24:01.360 --> 00:24:04.060
He took it easy on me on purpose.

00:24:04.060 --> 00:24:09.580
How dare that Xyz loser insult me like that!

00:24:10.460 --> 00:24:14.180
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Resonating Dragons

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:16.800
The fun is only getting started!
